---
import Header from '../components/core/Header';
import FooterNav from '../components/core/FooterNav';
import Container from '../components/layout/Container';
import Section from '../components/layout/Section';
import TipBox from '../components/layout/TipBox';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
    <title>Deadlock Counter Items Guide - Counter Every Hero</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Complete guide to countering every hero in Deadlock with smart item builds. Learn which items counter multiple heroes and entire team compositions at once."
    />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Deadlock Counter Items Guide - Counter Every Hero" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Complete guide to countering every hero in Deadlock with smart item builds." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header title="Counter Items Guide" showBackLink={true} backHref="/" client:load />
    <main>
      <Container maxWidth="md">
        <Section id="overview">
          <TipBox title="Guide Overview" variant="info">
            <p>
              Most Deadlock guides focus on countering heroes individually. This guide is different:
              learn to build smarter by using items that counter multiple heroes and entire team
              compositions at once.
            </p>
            <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
              Instead of memorizing individual matchups, understand which items give you the most
              value against the majority of teams you face.
            </p>
            <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
              <strong>TL;DR?</strong> Check out the{' '}
              <a href="/counter-cheatsheet" style="color: var(--accent-orange); text-decoration: underline;">
                Quick Cheatsheet
              </a>{' '}
              for instant hero-specific counters.
            </p>
          </TipBox>
        </Section>

        <Section id="passive-items" title="🛡️ Passive Items">
          <p>
            Passive items are silent lifesavers that do the work for you. If you're often dying to
            chain CC or setups you can't react to, these are your best choice.
          </p>

          <div style="margin-top: var(--spacing-lg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-md);">
            <div style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: var(--spacing-md); border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);">
              <h3 style="color: var(--accent-orange); margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Reactive Barrier</h3>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">
                <strong>Cost:</strong> 1600 souls | <strong>Tier:</strong> 2
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">
                Automatically activates when hit by any form of crowd control, creating a barrier.
              </p>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">
                <strong>Counters:</strong> Bebop (Hook), Abrams (Shoulder Charge), Doorman (Cart Combo)
              </p>
              <TipBox variant="success" title="Pro Tip">
                No-brainer to buy as early as laning phase into teams with lots of CC. Insanely good
                against heroes that rely on locking you down.
              </TipBox>
            </div>

            <div style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: var(--spacing-md); border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);">
              <h3 style="color: var(--accent-orange); margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Debuff Reducer</h3>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">
                Reduces the duration of stuns, slows, and even ultimates that apply CC effects.
              </p>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">
                <strong>Counters:</strong> Abrams (Stun), Holiday (Lasso), Moe (Ultimate)
              </p>
              <TipBox variant="success" title="Pro Tip">
                Perfect if you're tired of being stunlocked. Builds into Debuff Remover, a fantastic active item.
              </TipBox>
            </div>
          </div>
        </Section>

        <Section id="active-items" title="⚡ Active Items">
          <p>
            Active items require you to press a button, but they're worth it. These can completely
            neutralize dangerous abilities or save your life in critical moments.
          </p>

          <div style="margin-top: var(--spacing-lg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-md);">
            <div style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: var(--spacing-md); border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);">
              <h3 style="color: var(--accent-orange); margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Slowing Hex</h3>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">
                <strong>Cost:</strong> 1600 souls | <strong>Tier:</strong> 2
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">
                Disarms and slows the target, preventing them from shooting or using abilities.
              </p>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">
                <strong>Counters:</strong> Abrams, Lash, Wraith, Pocket
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: var(--spacing-md); border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);">
              <h3 style="color: var(--accent-orange); margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Debuff Remover</h3>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">
                <strong>Cost:</strong> 3500 souls | <strong>Tier:</strong> 3
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">
                Removes all debuffs and provides temporary debuff immunity.
              </p>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">
                <strong>Counters:</strong> All CC-heavy heroes, especially combo-dependent characters
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </Section>

        <Section id="anti-heal" title="💉 Anti-Heal Items">
          <p>
            Anti-heal items are essential against heroes with high sustain or healing abilities.
          </p>

          <div style="margin-top: var(--spacing-lg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-md);">
            <div style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: var(--spacing-md); border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);">
              <h3 style="color: var(--accent-orange); margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Healbane</h3>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">
                <strong>Cost:</strong> 1600 souls | <strong>Tier:</strong> 2
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);">
                Applies 35% heal reduction to targets you damage.
              </p>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">
                <strong>Counters:</strong> Abrams, McGinnis, Wraith, any hero with lifesteal builds
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </Section>

        <TipBox variant="info" title="Need Quick Reference?">
          <p>
            For a searchable hero-by-hero counter lookup, check out the{' '}
            <a href="/counter-cheatsheet" style="color: var(--accent-orange); text-decoration: underline;">
              Counter Cheatsheet
            </a>.
          </p>
        </TipBox>
      </Container>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <FooterNav currentPage="counter-guide" client:load />
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
